{"id":"19a5fceb5d504d9f","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-provability-logic.md","title":"Provability Logic","display":"df-provability-logic — Provability Logic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-provability-logic","aliases":["89-df-provability-logic"],"display":"df-provability-logic — Provability Logic","depends_on":["[[89-df-realization-function]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-interpretation]]","[[89-df-modal-formula]]","[[89-df-provable-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-provability-logic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-provability-logic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-provability-logic — Provability Logic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a50ebde4b7b3e426\" href=\"?note=a50ebde4b7b3e426\" title=\"89-df-realization-function\">89-df-realization-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"55612987d4585fa4\" href=\"?note=55612987d4585fa4\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-interpretation\">89-df-arithmetical-interpretation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2d52ad4f119b4a14\" href=\"?note=2d52ad4f119b4a14\" title=\"89-df-provable-formula\">89-df-provable-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\)</span> is a recursively axiomatized arithmetical theory.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\)</span> is its set of provable sentences.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{R}_{T}\">\\(\\mathcal{R}_{T}\\)</span> is the set of realizations and\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{T,r}:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\">\\(\\tau_{T,r}:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\)</span> is the translation induced by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\mathcal{R}_{T}\">\\(r\\in\\mathcal{R}_{T}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provability\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PL}(T)\n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\nA\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\n\\ \\middle|\\ \\forall r\\in\\mathcal{R}_{T}\\,\n\\bigl(\\tau_{T,r}(A)\\in\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\\bigr)\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provability\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PL}(T)\n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\nA\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\n\\ \\middle|\\ \\forall r\\in\\mathcal{R}_{T}\\,\n\\bigl(\\tau_{T,r}(A)\\in\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\\bigr)\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PL}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{PL}(T)\\)</span> quantifies over every assignment of arithmetical sentences to\npropositional variables; the structural extension and the interpretation of\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\">\\(\\Box\\)</span> are supplied by <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"55612987d4585fa4\" href=\"?note=55612987d4585fa4\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-interpretation\">89-df-arithmetical-interpretation</a>.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-realization-function","status":"resolved","id":"a50ebde4b7b3e426","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-realization-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"55612987d4585fa4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-interpretation]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-provable-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2d52ad4f119b4a14","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-provable-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"55612987d4585fa4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PL}(T)$ quantifies over every assignment of arithmetical sentences to\npropositional variables; the structural extension and the interpretation of\n$\\Box$ are supplied by [[89-df-arithmetical-interpretation]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{R}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{T,r}:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in\\mathcal{R}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provability\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PL}(T)\n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\nA\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\n\\ \\middle|\\ \\forall r\\in\\mathcal{R}_{T}\\,\n\\bigl(\\tau_{T,r}(A)\\in\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\\bigr)\n\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PL}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box","display":false}],"bytes":1199,"backlinks":[{"id":"5994c5401e3dcdfd","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8220f4203bbba1d2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-29","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-provability-logic]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-379","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-provability-logic]]"}],"outgoing":["a50ebde4b7b3e426","55612987d4585fa4","56c1b5b75a32ca1d","2d52ad4f119b4a14"]}